The spoilers *greatly* underrate Stormy IMO.  Being
able to permanently reduce a monster one level per
hit is a huge long term advantage.  Sure, it does not
work on level-drain resistant monsters like V and &
but there aren't that many of those until you have
plenty of spell ability.  Attacking everything is a
real problem but it is more than offset once you
learn to be more carefull.

Given the choice between Stormy and Excalibur (not a
choice offered in many games) only the searching of
Excalibur beats Stormy for me.

What weapons are better?  Greyswandir is not available
to most characters who can get Stormy.


